[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="最后一阵浪推上外堤，卷走了半个浮标。它不动了以后，比活着的时候更像一件被人丢弃的机器：接缝开裂，线缆露在外面，还在往水里放很小的电火花。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="没有新的攻击征兆。别靠太近，先让损管班确认。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="刚才它是要来找我吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="它攻击的是外堤。我们现在能确认的就这些。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不管它想找谁，都把拉姆森的工具箱砸了。她等会儿会很生气，你最好帮我想个说法。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森正蹲在甲板上，把湿螺帽一颗颗摆开。她听见了，没有抬头，只向德雷顿伸出手。德雷顿叹气，把自己偷偷拿走的小扳手放回她掌心。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="东西少了还能补，人少了没地方领。先点名。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿。鞋丢一只，人没有。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="帕金斯。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森。莫里在回航线上，已经确认。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="轮到你的时候，你张了张嘴。没有名字可报这件事，第一次显得比海上的炮声更难应付。弗莱彻却没催，等你把那口气慢慢吐出来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我在。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="收到了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你以为那两个字需要一个真正的名字才能成立，她却在名单最后画了一个小小的勾。帕金斯把接触记录交给你，最后一行保留着你当时说过的“不确定”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="没改。以后有新的证据，往下面添，不往上面擦。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="也包括它没打我的那一次？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="包括。如果下一次不一样，也一样记。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="收音机彻底没了声音。远处的民居开始重新亮灯，没有人知道刚才有人承诺过一个能解释一切的名字。你一时觉得庆幸，一时又觉得自己还在听。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

